title mmWave Radar: Graph page (key 3): distance and speed of the last 30 s, one line per target; pause freezes it
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
env MMWAVE_DEMO three
env MMWAVE_TEST_CONFIG 1
env MMWAVE_TIMING 1

wait 12000
key 3
wait 600
shot graph
check graph
key space
wait 1500
shot graph-paused
expect noquit
